Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Export/Import Framework|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	Then ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Export|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Delete Export Template
Priority: 4
	Given LAR add Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	When LAR save Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And LAR view Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And LAR move To The Recycle Bin Export Template
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Recycle Bin|
	And RecycleBin view CP
		|assetName|Export Template Name|
		|assetType|Export Import Template|
		|deleteUser|Test Test|
	And RecycleBin restore CP
		|assetName|Export Template Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Export|
	And LAR goto Export Template CP
	Then LAR view Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
Scenario: Export With Relaunched Process
Priority: 3
	Given LAR configure Export Site CP
	When AssertClick the value 'Export' at locator 'SitePagesExport#EXPORT_BUTTON'
	And these variables
		|key_larFileName|${larFileName}|
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Successful' at locator 'SitePagesExport#CURRENT_AND_PREVIOUS_STATUS'
	And these variables
		|valueName|selenium#getText('//ul/li/div/h5')|
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And these variables
		|larFileName||
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And LAR relaunch Export
		|larFileName|${larFileName}|
	Then AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Successful' at locator 'SitePagesExport#CURRENT_AND_PREVIOUS_STATUS'
Scenario: Search Export Template
Priority: 4
	Given LAR add Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	When LAR configure Export Options
		|uncheckContentNameList|Blogs|
	And LAR save Export Template CP
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Publishing
		|portlet|Export|
	And LAR goto Export Template CP
	Then LAR search Template
		|exportTemplateDescription|Export Template Description|
		|exportTemplateName|Export Template Name|